// ============================================================================
//  mod_oldschool.zone  -  the MM1 grenade launcher and the Browning HP dual wield
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  User, 2026-09-26: port these two out of Mario Woopsie's "MOTD Old School
//  Weapons" (Nexus Mods, beta 1.3) into the box on every map they fit.
//
//  SOURCE: zone_source\oldschool_donor\mod.ff, --load'ed last in build_ff.bat.
//  how_this_was_built.zone.txt beside it has the Linker command. The MM1's art
//  is Treyarch's own, out of retail angola.ff (the campaign MM1, mgl_sp); MOTD's
//  copies were compared and are byte-identical. Only the Browning's two
//  left-hand models are MOTD's, because no retail file has them.
//
//  THE DEFS ARE NOT DECLARED HERE. They ship raw in weapons\zm\ like every
//  other port: mm1_zm, mm1_upgraded_zm, browninghpdw_zm, browninghplh_zm and
//  the two _upgraded_ forms. modding-jobs\motd-port-001\make_defs.py lists each
//  field that moved from MOTD's defs.
//
//  WHAT THE DEFS NAME AND NEED NOTHING NEW FOR, measured against the six map
//  listings and mod.ff: the Browning's icon, both muzzle flashes, the shell
//  ejects, the pistol tracer, the m203 flash, dud fx, projectile model and
//  reticle.
//
//  📝 THE LAST BLOCK RE-DECLARES NAMES mod_bo1guns.zone AND mod_base.zone
//  ALREADY LINK - the Browning's right-hand models and the 34 M1911 dual-wield
//  anims the Browning defs play. Re-declaring costs nothing (the Linker takes
//  each name once) and is what lets tools\check-weapon-port.py hold this zone
//  to everything the four Browning defs name: drop one from the other zones
//  and the build fails here instead of the gun losing an animation.
// ============================================================================

// --- models ------------------------------------------------------------------
xmodel,t6_wpn_launch_mm1_view
xmodel,t6_wpn_launch_mm1_world
xmodel,t6_wpn_pistol_browninghp_view_lh
xmodel,t6_wpn_pistol_browninghp_world_lh

// --- HUD icon (the Browning's menu_mp_weapons_browning is already in mod.ff) --
material,menu_mp_weapons_mm1

// --- the MM1 grenade's smoke trail. angola.ff only; declared so every map has it.
fx,maps/angola/fx_ang_trail_grenade

// --- Pack-a-Punch camo tables, raw in zone_assets\camo\ (names no stock zone owns)
camo,camo_qol_mm1
camo,camo_qol_browninghpdw

